---
title: 'Scrollbar Test'
---

## Scrollbar wheel

What to test:

- Hold `shift` and scroll the wheel over the series area, the x-axis, and the scrollbar track and thumb.
- Confirm each surface scrolls the visible range without zooming.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Scrollbar" name="scrollbar-wheel" type="generated" /%}

## Scrollbar with crossAt

What to test:

- Hover the y-axis; cursor switches to `ns-resize`, then reverts to `default` over a marker that overlaps the axis.
- Drag the y-axis to zoom, drag the series area to pan (cursor `grabbing`), and drag the y-axis scrollbar to pan (cursor stays `default`).
- Re-check the hover cursors above are still correct after interacting.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Scrollbar with crossAt" name="scrollbar-cross-at" type="generated" /%}
